# Font pack groups for assets/fonts (fontpack pack --manifest fonts.manifest).
# A font joins the first group, in this order, with a pattern matching its
# file name. Exactly the eager groups decode when the library starts; a lazy
# group decodes the first time one of its fonts is needed. The split below
# is a proposal for measurement, not a decision.

# The control faces (Portsmouth Rapids, the earlier Portsmouth faces and
# Portsmouth Mono) and the content body face (Carlito, font-substitution.json
# "content_family").
group interface eager
Portsmouth*.ttf
Carlito-*.ttf

# Substitution families named by font-substitution.json.
group families lazy
Arimo-*.ttf
Cousine-*.ttf
Tinos-*.ttf
Selawik-*.ttf

# Script fallbacks other than CJK.
group scripts lazy
NotoSansArabic-*.ttf
NotoSansHebrew-*.ttf
NotoSansDevanagari-*.ttf
NotoSansBengali-*.ttf
NotoSansGurmukhi-*.ttf

group emoji lazy
NotoEmoji-*.ttf

group cjk lazy
NotoSansCJK*
